      "value": "Thanks to TCL on Discord, he had found the issue that will cause this error(1640).\n\nIf you have a missing material slot in the particle, it will cause this error, And will need to place the same material into the Trail slot to fix it.\n\nThis is still an issue regardless, and Will need to be fixed.",
